    Evaluation: 7, Serviceable. Mechanized and documented; recognition,
    response, and world interfaces remain abstract pending concrete regulator
    instances. Not peer reviewed.


4 - Files
    -----

    L002_00_Premises.v

      Core vocabulary: `AsIF`, mirror positions, recognition certificates,
      world/brain/model frames, control questions, and operational interfaces.

    L002_01__Mirror_Unrefutability.v

      Full-fixed-point collapse, live mirror irrefutability, recognition
      exclusion, and the world/brain/model control chain.

    L002_02__Recursive_Mirror_Lemma.v

      Finite mirror iteration and the bounded and unbounded
      `yes`-or-reentry results.

    L002_03__Symbolic_Regulation.v

      Finite-state recurrence, attribution, provenance observations, and
      conditional externalization.

    L002_95_API.v

      Stable contracts.

    L002_97_Artifacts.v

      Certified endpoints and assumption reports.

    L002_98_Sanity.v

      Compile-time probes of the public surface.


