6 - Scope
    -----

    `External` marks a metatheoretically supplied condition; it does not assert
    external causal origin. Attribution tags and response laws likewise record
    formal codings, not verified provenance.

    `recursive_mirror_formula` is a structurally recursive definition of finite
    iteration. It is neither a Rocq axiom nor a claim of physical or infinite
    execution.

    L002 proves results about checked derivability, finite certificates,
    formula iteration, and explicitly modeled response traces. Claims about
    nontermination, resource exhaustion, psychology, causal control, or real
    evaluators require additional operational or empirical bridges.
